<title>USA: Sprint Corp picks NEC to supply equipment.</title>
<headline>Sprint Corp picks NEC to supply equipment.</headline>
<dateline>HERNDON, Va. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sprint Corp said it selected NEC America Inc, a unit of Japan's NEC Corp, to provide transmission equipment for use in Sprint's local telephone operations.</p>
<p>Sprint has forecast purchases of over $50 million of the synchronous optical network equipment from NEC, it said. Sprint is also expanding use for other gear from NEC.</p>
</text>
